<li><strong>s</strong> - snub (=<em>dgd</em>)</li>
<li><strong>p</strong> - propellor</li>
<li><strong>c</strong> - chamfer</li>
<li><strong>w</strong> - whirl</li>
<li><strong>q</strong> - quinto</li>
<li><strong>l</strong> - loft</li>
<li><strong>K</strong> - stake</li>
<li><strong>L</strong> - lace</li>
<li><strong>I</strong> - join-lace</li>
